### Healthcheck
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### GET all TODOs
GET http://localhost:8080/todos

### GET TODO by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/todos/1

### Create TODO
POST http://localhost:8080/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Go",
  "description": "Build a REST API with Go and PostgreSQL"
}

### Update TODO
PUT http://localhost:8080/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Go Advanced"
}

### Delete TODO
DELETE http://localhost:8080/todos/1

### GET all Notes
GET http://localhost:8080/notes

### GET Note by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/notes/1

### Create Note
POST http://localhost:8080/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "The mitochondria is the powerhouse of the cell"
}

### Update Note
PUT http://localhost:8080/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "The mitochondria produces ATP through cellular respiration"
}

### Delete Note
DELETE http://localhost:8080/notes/1

### Start a new quiz conversation
POST http://localhost:8080/quiz/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": []
}

### Continue an existing quiz conversation
POST http://localhost:8080/quiz/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "2468b843668ec04a285e07f66a18f00f",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What significant event occurred in 1707 that involved the Kingdom of England and the Kingdom of Scotland?"
    },
    { "role": "user", "content": "A union was formed" }
  ]
}